%% MosaicKit – proposed destination-aware publication strategy (future feature; see CODEBASE_KNOWLEDGE.md F12 design note)
graph TD
  A[Resolve final URL] --> B{URLResourceValues}
  B -->|isUbiquitousItem| C[Stage in local temp dir]
  C --> C2[NSFileCoordinator write .forReplacing → replaceItemAt / moveItem]
  B -->|volumeIsLocal == false| D[Encode into local temp dir]
  D --> D2[Sequential copy → hidden staging in destination dir]
  D2 --> D3{overwrite?}
  D3 -->|yes| D4[rename - server-side atomic]
  D3 -->|no| D5[exclusive claim + rename; delete placeholder on failure; documented non-atomic]
  B -->|local volume| E[Stage in destination dir]
  E --> E2{overwrite?}
  E2 -->|yes| E3[rename / replaceItemAt]
  E2 -->|no| E4{volumeSupportsExclusiveRenaming}
  E4 -->|yes| E5[renamex_np RENAME_EXCL - atomic, no placeholder]
  E4 -->|no| E6[link fallback or placeholder path]
